    "preamble": "Rahul Prakash Shete vs The State Of Maharashtra And Another on 17 May, 2024 1 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Bench At Aurangabad. Anticipatory Bail Application No.832 Of 2024 Rahul Prakash Shete .. Applicant Versus The State of Maharashtra and Another .. Respondents ..... Advocate for Applicant : Shri. C. R. Deshpande App for the Respdts No.1 & 2 / State : Shri. S. R. Wakale ..... Coram : Neeraj P. Dhote, J. (Vacation Court) Dated : 17Th May, 2024 Per Court : - .",
    "facts": "The Applicant is seeking Anticipatory Bail in connection with Crime No.95 of 2024 registered with Sarangkheda Police Station, Dist. Nandurbar for the offences punishable under Sections 328, 272, 273, 188 of the Indian Penal Code and under Sections 26 (2)(iv), 27 (3)(d) (e), 30 (2)(a), 3 (1)(ZZ)(i)(v) and 59 of Food Safety and Standards Act. The aforesaid crime is registered at the instance of policemen. During investigation, it was revealed that the Rahul Prakash Shete vs The State Of Maharashtra And Another on 17 May, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/66959925/ 1 arrested accused purchased the said banned articles from the Applicant.",
